new root concept we need, I have a few different word shape options derived from real-world source languages\":{\"text\":\"sho spa rvduthod shinej ra ne nido, me khabho ce chvzu khagej ti legzusheb re kwmo om sorzulangu pherdej\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"I’m going to introduce the source word, try my very best to pronounce it correctly—please forgive me in advance for butchering anything—and then show you what that word looks like adapted into Kalob’s phonology\":{\"text\":\"me spreza sorzulegz, vd me tezda spigo ikregdezh zha—ed phorlo plezh phrozh ma pro azh khib—vd stv me spreza ada klezh ska legz shebo tranzej pho svndustem obh Kalob.\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"You’ll notice the slices on this wheel aren't equal\":{\"text\":\"de chyana kw parjhu ib ag rodh nu qibho.\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"The weighting here is actually mathematical\":{\"text\":\"ag qhed seno pherzh nwmbej\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"I inverted the proportion of existing Kalob words derived from these source languages\":{\"text\":\"me sede rad obh legzu svbhij ti Kalob re kwmo om ajhe sorzulangu.\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Basically\":{\"text\":\"simbezh\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"the fewer words we currently have from a specific language, the bigger its slice on the wheel\":{\"text\":\"sri kw ne khabho kyorzh lezh legzu om az lang, zhea parjh ib rodh seno elarjhej\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"We want to prioritize languages that have less coverage so Kalob's lexicon stays beautifully diverse\":{\"text\":\"ne qhando qhedo plizh langu re khabho lezh legzu po legzustem obh Kalob cagdo khago thedezh\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Alright, let’s get into the first word\":{\"text\":\"zhe ukargo, en stardo talgo phwnidh legz\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Word\":{\"text\":\"legz\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"The tab of the browser is switched to show the slices for the first word concept\":{\"text\":\"uphlvjh obh nedusprezib chenjhuo plw sprezo parjhu sho phwnidh legzuthod\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Our first concept for today is the word for\":{\"text\":\"nea phwnidh thod pro ag tag seno legz sho\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"English meaning\":{\"text\":\"thod au Inglvsh\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Here are the options\":{\"text\":\"chi chvzu\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Our first option comes from\":{\"text\":\"nea phwnidh chvz kwmo om\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Source Language A\":{\"text\":\"sorzulang A\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"The original word is\":{\"text\":\"legz rijhej seno\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Source Word A\":{\"text\":\"sorzulegz A\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"—pronounced roughly like\":{\"text\":\"—langusenguo korzezh sv\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Attempt pronunciation\":{\"text\":\"ed tezdo languseng\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Adapted to fit Kalob's phonotactics, the word shape becomes\":{\"text\":\"khw zhe chenjhuo plw phido sengureg Kalob, legzusheb skido\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Kalob Shape A\":{\"text\":\"sheb Kalob A\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Because we already have a decent chunk of vocabulary from\":{\"text\":\"wb ne khabho kazh an klwmb okargej ti legzu chvzej om\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\", it only gets a\":{\"text\":\", zhe sibha an\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"30%\":{\"text\":\"threzen pro khwnd\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"slice on the wheel\":{\"text\":\"parjh ib rodh\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Our second option comes from\":{\"text\":\"nea tvbhidh chvzig kwmo om\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Source Language B\":{\"text\":\"sorzulang Bx\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Source Word B\":{\"text\":\"sorzulegz Bx\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\", pronounced\":{\"text\":\"langusenguo\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Adapted into Kalob, this becomes\":{\"text\":\"khw zhe chenjhuo khi Kalob, ag skido\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"Kalob Shape B\":{\"text\":\"sheb Kalob Bx\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"},\"The source word is\":{\"text\":\"sorzulegz seno\",\"note\":\"\",\"bookmark\":null,\"segmentType\":\"Body\",\"outlineLevel\":\"Level 2\"